WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.020 --> 00:01.970
[Disclaimer: Characters, locations, and all depicted events are fictional

3
00:01.990 --> 00:03.940
and for entertainment purposes only; viewer discretion is advised]

4
00:11.720 --> 00:13.370
It's true that I wanted you out back then,

5
00:13.750 --> 00:15.290
but now, there's nowhere else I want you to be.

6
00:16.239 --> 00:16.990
I like it...

7
00:17.600 --> 00:18.720
In a series...

8
00:18.820 --> 00:20.560
the two male leads have gotta kiss now, right?

9
00:20.660 --> 00:21.840
Let me ask you, Wan.

10
00:21.940 --> 00:23.200
Do you like me

11
00:23.580 --> 00:24.920
or Third more?

12
00:26.190 --> 00:27.310
You're both fucking assholes.

13
00:29.000 --> 00:30.410
About #ThirdWan...

14
00:30.430 --> 00:31.440
Why say sorry about that?

15
00:31.670 --> 00:32.560
What for?

16
00:32.610 --> 00:33.680
So you're not maintaining your image anymore?

17
00:33.700 --> 00:34.640
I'm gonna expose you.

18
00:34.950 --> 00:36.200
About what?

19
00:36.400 --> 00:37.240
What do you think...

20
00:37.300 --> 00:38.680
they're gonna expose about each other?

21
00:48.720 --> 00:49.800
Did you finish reading all of it?

22
00:50.590 --> 00:51.280
Huh?

23
00:52.390 --> 00:53.880
I asked, "Did you finish reading all of it?"

24
00:54.150 --> 00:54.990
Not yet.

25
00:55.270 --> 00:56.270
So why are you staring at me?

26
00:57.790 --> 00:58.640
Nothing.

27
00:59.420 --> 01:00.520
Keep reading.

28
01:02.230 --> 01:04.170
Shit, I don't think I'm gonna finish in time.

29
01:04.190 --> 01:06.360
I need more time to memorize the vocabulary.

30
01:07.390 --> 01:08.390
Want me to tutor you?

31
01:08.990 --> 01:10.480
We can make flashcards together.

32
01:13.350 --> 01:14.390
Thank you, bud.

33
01:14.980 --> 01:15.960
Anytime.

34
01:18.980 --> 01:21.140
If I get this scholarship, you've gotta fly to see me.

35
01:26.110 --> 01:28.090
Do you know my biggest dream

36
01:28.580 --> 01:30.180
isn't just getting this scholarship?

37
01:32.750 --> 01:33.759
So what is it?

38
01:36.200 --> 01:39.000
You're gonna wanna sit down for this, brother.

39
01:40.200 --> 01:41.400
Damn you! Just spit it out.

40
01:43.210 --> 01:44.140
Come here. Closer.

41
01:44.160 --> 01:45.240
I'll tell you.

42
01:46.390 --> 01:47.320
I wanna be an actor!

43
01:47.940 --> 01:48.640
Huh?!

44
01:48.960 --> 01:50.000
But why?

45
01:50.479 --> 01:51.720
Well, I'll get to shine so bright.

46
01:52.000 --> 01:53.750
Wherever I go, people will swarm around me, screaming

47
01:53.770 --> 01:54.770
and taking photos.

48
01:54.789 --> 01:57.180
"Argh, Nine, Nine, Nine, Nine!"

49
01:58.390 --> 02:00.160
Damn... Just thinking about it feels like a dream.

50
02:00.880 --> 02:03.580
What else could I possibly be with this look?

51
02:05.890 --> 02:07.170
So, with the way I look...

52
02:07.200 --> 02:08.320
do you think

53
02:09.090 --> 02:09.919
I'm cute?

54
02:14.480 --> 02:15.040
Yeah,

55
02:15.390 --> 02:16.079
you're...

56
02:16.280 --> 02:17.150
pretty cute.

57
02:17.170 --> 02:18.040
There!

58
02:18.720 --> 02:19.880
You're my first ever boy.

59
02:27.300 --> 02:28.160
What boy?

60
02:28.810 --> 02:30.200
My fanboy, of course!

61
02:30.320 --> 02:32.120
Why? Do you wanna be my screen partner?

62
02:32.570 --> 02:33.400
Shit, but...

63
02:34.070 --> 02:35.140
Damn it, if we act together,

64
02:35.160 --> 02:37.000
I'm gonna laugh at your face like I am now.

65
02:38.690 --> 02:40.720
We just have to look at each other to laugh.

66
02:40.980 --> 02:42.440
Do you think we can act together?

67
02:46.520 --> 02:47.840
You're getting ahead of yourself.

68
02:47.990 --> 02:49.180
Keep reading.

69
02:54.300 --> 02:55.380
Hey, but...

70
02:55.400 --> 02:57.280
Here, I'll just go ahead and tutor you.

71
02:57.560 --> 02:58.960
Sheesh...

72
02:58.980 --> 03:00.100
Professor Third, by the way.

73
03:01.590 --> 03:02.680
Here it is, right here.

74
03:09.360 --> 03:11.030
♫I'm just a fanboy♫

75
03:16.760 --> 03:18.440
♫I'm just a fanboy♫

76
03:24.160 --> 03:25.670
