77
03:25.690 --> 03:27.380
♫I wanna let the world know, you wanna close it♫

78
03:27.400 --> 03:29.280
♫Just wanna tell you, I'm doing fine, fine♫

79
03:29.310 --> 03:31.210
♫You won't reveal it, but I won't conceal it♫

80
03:31.240 --> 03:33.010
♫Trust me, it's alright♫

81
03:33.030 --> 03:34.800
♫You do you♫

82
03:34.820 --> 03:36.700
♫You can love whoever♫

83
03:36.720 --> 03:38.900
♫But I like you forever♫

84
03:38.930 --> 03:40.160
♫I'm just a fanboy♫

85
03:40.180 --> 03:42.210
♫No pressure, no drama♫

86
03:42.230 --> 03:44.030
♫Hakuna Matata♫

87
03:44.050 --> 03:46.130
♫Just somebody who likes ya♫

88
03:46.170 --> 03:48.160
♫I'm just a fanboy♫

89
03:48.180 --> 03:49.650
♫I'm just a fanboy♫

90
03:49.670 --> 03:51.470
♫No pressure, no drama♫

91
03:51.490 --> 03:53.300
♫Hakuna Matata♫

92
03:53.320 --> 03:55.550
♫Just somebody who likes ya♫

93
03:55.570 --> 03:57.240
♫I'm just a fanboy♫

94
04:17.730 --> 04:19.680
♫I'm just a fanboy♫

95
04:20.600 --> 04:22.620
[Mr. Fanboy Series]

96
04:22.640 --> 04:26.000
[Episode 6: "War"]

97
04:32.200 --> 04:33.920
Wait outside for now. I'll call on you.

98
04:44.020 --> 04:45.600
You said you wanted Wan to become famous?

99
04:46.990 --> 04:47.880
Hey...

100
04:49.430 --> 04:51.200
It's nothing.

101
04:52.490 --> 04:54.480
A reporter asked, so I answered.

102
04:55.510 --> 04:57.240
You said, "It's nothing," again.

103
04:59.800 --> 05:01.220
You do know

104
05:02.000 --> 05:04.000
I became a producer for this series

105
05:04.480 --> 05:06.680
because I wanted you to play the lead, right?

106
05:06.800 --> 05:07.690
Yes.

107
05:07.710 --> 05:09.120
That's what I used to believe.

108
05:09.810 --> 05:12.120
And I used to think you'd never let me down again.

109
05:13.000 --> 05:13.630
Nine...

110
05:13.650 --> 05:15.260
I wasn't the main one in the last series yet,

111
05:15.280 --> 05:16.130
and that's fine.

112
05:16.150 --> 05:18.040
There was nothing I could do since I wasn't the lead.

113
05:18.870 --> 05:20.640
But I'm already the lead in this one.

114
05:20.790 --> 05:22.260
It's different now.

115
05:22.280 --> 05:25.090
You know how long I've been waiting for this.

116
05:31.540 --> 05:32.720
Wow...

117
05:33.159 --> 05:35.240
So many fans came to see you today.

118
05:35.400 --> 05:36.120
Are you tired?

119
05:36.490 --> 05:37.400
A bit, Mama.

120
05:37.420 --> 05:38.740
Here, take a seat.

121
05:39.690 --> 05:41.280
There. I'll get you some water.

122
05:41.790 --> 05:42.710
Thank you.

123
06:04.480 --> 06:05.640
Why do you always make a scene?

124
06:08.300 --> 06:09.800
You think you're the main lead?

125
06:10.180 --> 06:10.880
Hm?

126
06:11.890 --> 06:13.320
Talking longer than the main leads...

127
06:13.840 --> 06:14.840
it's cringe.

128
06:16.810 --> 06:18.000
It's like you're trying too hard.

129
06:19.400 --> 06:22.020
If you wanna cause a scene, wait till you're famous, will you?

130
06:24.120 --> 06:25.560
If you can even be famous, that is.

131
06:26.500 --> 06:27.100
Hey.

132
06:29.310 --> 06:31.320
You think you can say anything just because you're famous?

133
06:31.360 --> 06:32.200
Well, I already said it.

134
06:32.220 --> 06:33.040
Can I?

135
06:34.680 --> 06:35.880
If people find out

136
06:36.060 --> 06:37.840
that the sweet Juno

137
06:38.590 --> 06:40.440
talks to a coworker like this,

138
06:41.820 --> 06:42.680
what would they say?

139
06:44.150 --> 06:45.480
What a cliche threat.

140
06:46.740 --> 06:48.320
Have you really thought through

141
06:49.270 --> 06:50.840
who'd actually believe what an extra says?

142
06:51.130 --> 06:53.760
So why are you afraid of an extra stealing your thunder?

143
06:54.570 --> 06:55.120
Okay.

144
06:56.100 --> 06:57.560
From now on, I won't talk too much.

145
06:57.900 --> 06:58.690
Happy?

146
06:59.100 --> 06:59.780
Mm...

147
07:00.700 --> 07:01.800
You catch on fast.

148
07:02.160 --> 07:03.400
I'd say you're not stupid.

149
07:08.660 --> 07:09.370
Right...

150
07:10.780 --> 07:12.880
Congrats on gaining more fans.

151
07:13.480 --> 07:16.080
I guess people enjoy seeing something fresh.

152
07:16.400 --> 07:20.240
But don't think you'll be a star just because of those loud squeals,

153
07:21.080 --> 07:22.320
because in this industry,

154
07:22.800 --> 07:24.520
skills matter, too.

155
07:27.140 --> 07:27.710
Hey,

156
07:29.070 --> 07:30.200
do you hate me, Juno?

157
07:30.460 --> 07:31.200
Mm.

158
07:35.240 --> 07:37.120
If you're not happy with that, resign from the project.

159
07:37.850 --> 07:38.570
Someone like you

160
07:38.590 --> 07:40.600
probably comes a dime a dozen out there.

161
07:42.760 --> 07:43.600
Angry?

162
07:43.950 --> 07:45.360
Good. I like that.

163
07:47.200 --> 07:47.840
Come on, Aof.

164
07:48.090 --> 07:48.840
Let's head back.

165
07:49.800 --> 07:50.760
Hey... Mama.

166
07:55.480 --> 07:56.159
Move.

167
08:01.680 --> 08:02.560
Whoa, Mama!

168
08:19.320 --> 08:20.440
I won't say that again.

169
08:26.190 --> 08:27.200
Sorry, babe.

170
08:38.590 --> 08:39.870
"Who do you think you are?

171
08:41.990 --> 08:43.280
Not answering?

172
08:44.030 --> 08:45.920
You think I can't do anything to you?

173
08:46.830 --> 08:48.440
Truth is truth.

174
08:49.240 --> 08:50.840
No matter what you're hiding,

175
08:51.700 --> 08:53.080
everyone will find out one day."

176
08:57.330 --> 08:58.210
Cut!

177
08:58.230 --> 08:59.280
That's good, Wan.

178
08:59.640 --> 09:00.640
I totally bought that.

179
09:03.440 --> 09:06.040
That's very interesting, Wan.

180
09:06.330 --> 09:07.520
What did you do?

181
09:07.840 --> 09:09.200
I read the script.

182
09:09.810 --> 09:10.680
Really?

183
09:10.940 --> 09:11.640
What?

184
09:11.910 --> 09:13.340
I'm just asking, yeah?

185
09:14.840 --> 09:15.920
Because...

186
09:16.300 --> 09:17.400
it's channeling...

187
09:17.880 --> 09:19.000
"realistic."

188
09:21.110 --> 09:23.120
That means your acting was convincing.

189
09:23.480 --> 09:24.740
Oh...

190
09:24.760 --> 09:25.720
Oh... that's right.

191
09:25.820 --> 09:27.120
I forgot I have to translate it.

192
09:28.000 --> 09:29.080
Okay, take a break.

193
09:29.880 --> 09:30.720
I like it.

194
09:30.830 --> 09:33.000
Feel free to go and relax.

195
09:33.610 --> 09:34.750
"I like it" means...

196
09:34.770 --> 09:35.930
- he likes... - I think he understands that part.

197
09:35.960 --> 09:36.820
Right, right.

198
09:37.220 --> 09:38.130
Thank you.

199
09:38.150 --> 09:38.920
Of course.

200
09:39.680 --> 09:40.500
Okay...

201
09:40.810 --> 09:42.260
I want...

202
09:42.400 --> 09:43.760
both of you to try

203
09:43.810 --> 09:45.910
picking up some techniques from their performance.

204
09:46.330 --> 09:48.400
This is about the scale of it.

205
09:49.020 --> 09:50.060
Hey, thank you.

206
09:50.080 --> 09:50.680
Hm?

207
09:53.280 --> 09:55.720
Luang seems to be satisfied with my acting.

208
09:57.650 --> 09:58.840
I didn't do anything.

209
09:59.690 --> 10:00.940
It was all your hard work.

210
10:02.590 --> 10:04.400
Just let me thank you. It's no big deal.

211
10:09.000 --> 10:10.960
Guys, I brought you some drinks.

212
10:11.220 --> 10:12.160
Here you go.

213
10:13.380 --> 10:14.860
Here's your drink.

214
10:15.510 --> 10:17.400
Hey, you're getting the gist of the game.

215
10:18.000 --> 10:18.760
Good on you.

216
10:19.220 --> 10:20.640
Here's your drink, Nine.

217
10:28.090 --> 10:29.380
I'm taking a quick restroom break.

218
10:30.520 --> 10:31.560
Take your time.

219
10:32.470 --> 10:35.280
In today's class, we'll dig deep into,

220
10:35.300 --> 10:36.720
or look into,

221
10:36.780 --> 10:38.720
the characters' desires.

222
10:38.780 --> 10:40.640
This exercise is called

223
10:41.210 --> 10:43.320
"Animal Exercise."

224
10:43.690 --> 10:44.360
Animal!

225
10:45.810 --> 10:47.200
Think of an animal...

226
10:47.340 --> 10:48.480
that your character embodies.

227
10:48.630 --> 10:50.570
Alright, find your own place to lie down.

228
10:50.590 --> 10:51.800
Relax.

229
10:51.980 --> 10:54.090
Feel the sensation

230
10:54.110 --> 10:56.280
as your body presses against the floor.

231
10:56.730 --> 10:58.900
Slowly transform your body

232
10:58.920 --> 11:01.060
until you eventually become that animal.

233
11:01.230 --> 11:02.400
Three...

234
11:03.090 --> 11:04.080
Two...

235
11:04.100 --> 11:05.520
Close your eyes, close them.

236
11:05.850 --> 11:06.680
And one.

237
11:08.500 --> 11:10.080
And after that,

238
11:10.900 --> 11:13.080
slowly open your eyes.

239
11:14.090 --> 11:15.960
Feel that sensation in your body.

240
11:16.660 --> 11:19.190
Now, feel the energy

241
11:19.210 --> 11:21.500
and the urge to make a sound.

242
11:21.520 --> 11:22.270
Be honest,

243
11:22.290 --> 11:25.160
and make the sound of the animal you are.

244
11:25.280 --> 11:27.170
That's good, Nine. Amazing. I'm getting goosebumps.

245
11:27.290 --> 11:27.880
Nice.

246
11:27.900 --> 11:29.030
Very good, Renji.

247
11:29.050 --> 11:29.900
Very good.

248
11:30.720 --> 11:32.160
Charge at another animal

249
11:32.180 --> 11:34.070
with your energy, your voice,

250
11:34.090 --> 11:35.380
and your body.

251
11:35.860 --> 11:36.900
Good...

252
11:38.800 --> 11:40.910
I'll throw this piece of meat.

253
11:40.930 --> 11:43.100
It's your last meal.

254
11:43.120 --> 11:44.360
Whoever gets it

255
11:44.460 --> 11:45.360
survives.

256
11:48.100 --> 11:48.820
Nice, nice.

257
11:55.950 --> 11:58.040
Trust me when I say, on the first day of filming,

258
11:58.150 --> 12:00.160
I'm refusing to succumb to any B-words out there!

259
12:00.600 --> 12:02.280
Any B-words who dare compete, bring it on.

260
12:02.380 --> 12:04.820
You'll catch me fighting from hairline to nape.

261
12:05.360 --> 12:06.060
Fabulous!

262
12:06.090 --> 12:07.400
Yes, he's the antagonist, and?

263
12:07.420 --> 12:08.230
He's crashing 'em with his chest.

264
12:08.250 --> 12:09.480
To hell with them!

265
12:09.860 --> 12:11.040
Let me take a look at your face.

266
12:11.390 --> 12:12.880
Dolly eyes, check.

267
12:12.910 --> 12:14.490
Contouring, check.

268
12:14.510 --> 12:15.470
Highlighting, check.

269
12:15.490 --> 12:16.220
Fabulous!

270
12:16.240 --> 12:17.520
- Spot on. - With this,

271
12:17.820 --> 12:19.360
you're piercing through the camera,

272
12:19.380 --> 12:21.160
out through the TV,

273
12:21.200 --> 12:22.560
and landing right in your fan's face!

274
12:22.710 --> 12:23.470
Yes,

275
12:23.540 --> 12:24.220
because...

276
12:24.240 --> 12:26.080
Mama didn't raise a loser!

277
12:26.210 --> 12:28.610
Those crinkly, sky-loft HMUAs,

278
12:28.630 --> 12:29.190
watch out,

279
12:29.210 --> 12:31.160
'cause I'll curse them out of the building!

280
12:31.320 --> 12:32.240
Fabulous!

281
12:32.260 --> 12:33.010
Right,

282
12:33.030 --> 12:34.110
seriously though,

283
12:34.130 --> 12:37.120
why hold such an insane grudge against those sky-loft HMUAs?

284
12:37.240 --> 12:38.240
Tyrannical.

285
12:38.270 --> 12:39.120
Lowballers.

286
12:39.140 --> 12:40.600
They treated us like a fucking doormat.

287
12:40.620 --> 12:42.160
Am I supposed to repay them with flowers?

288
12:42.690 --> 12:43.960
Only one kind of flower will do the job.

289
12:44.210 --> 12:45.520
- Stink bell! - Stink bell!

290
12:45.800 --> 12:47.040
Right on!

291
12:48.100 --> 12:49.060
Did that blast your ears?

292
12:50.680 --> 12:51.880
Natural-looking skin is a must.

293
12:51.900 --> 12:53.400
I'll give you a nice cut crease.

294
12:53.570 --> 12:55.320
Today, Mama's male lead will blow 'em away like...

295
12:55.350 --> 12:56.680
"Pow! Pow! Pow!"

296
12:56.730 --> 12:58.110
So cinematic, you go, "Bam, bam, bam!"

297
12:58.130 --> 12:59.360
From every single angle, okay?

298
12:59.800 --> 13:00.310
Yeah...

299
13:00.330 --> 13:01.840
Your energy is killing it today.

300
13:01.870 --> 13:03.180
Abso-freaking-lutely, Mama!

301
13:03.200 --> 13:04.640
I'm giving it my all

302
13:04.790 --> 13:06.440
to show those minions

303
13:07.090 --> 13:09.470
who's boss in this battle.

304
13:11.300 --> 13:12.000
True that.

305
13:12.120 --> 13:14.300
Those brush-and-hairdryer newbies,

306
13:14.320 --> 13:15.080
yuck!

307
13:15.110 --> 13:16.860
If that were me, I wouldn't hire them, either.

308
13:17.360 --> 13:18.100
Disgusting!

309
13:18.580 --> 13:20.420
I feel bad for Renji and Wan, though.

310
13:20.440 --> 13:21.840
With some shabby MUA

311
13:22.060 --> 13:23.240
doing a sloppy job,

312
13:23.570 --> 13:25.080
they're not gonna look as sharp

313
13:25.110 --> 13:26.850
as you two.

314
13:26.870 --> 13:27.560
Uh...

315
13:27.830 --> 13:28.880
Susan,

316
13:29.000 --> 13:30.520
- so... - What's up?

317
13:31.980 --> 13:32.820
I've heard something,

318
13:32.840 --> 13:34.520
but I don't know if it's true.

319
13:37.160 --> 13:38.280
What is it? Spill.

320
13:39.600 --> 13:42.290
I heard that Wan...

321
13:42.310 --> 13:44.500
said some bad things about Third.

322
13:44.520 --> 13:46.280
Like, really damaging things.

323
13:46.600 --> 13:47.100
Whoa...

324
13:47.120 --> 13:48.320
He said that Third was...

325
13:48.800 --> 13:50.480
a lot to handle

326
13:51.020 --> 13:52.680
and egotistical.

327
13:52.960 --> 13:53.770
Brutal!

328
13:53.790 --> 13:55.120
Yes, it's brutal, but...

329
13:55.520 --> 13:58.240
I think I should find a way to talk it out with him first.

330
13:58.270 --> 13:58.880
Ugh...

331
13:59.210 --> 14:00.740
no need to put this on your plate.

332
14:00.760 --> 14:02.920
When the timing is perfect,

333
14:03.070 --> 14:04.360
I'll handle it myself,

334
14:04.380 --> 14:05.100
okay?

335
14:05.190 --> 14:06.160
Backhanded positivity?

336
14:08.780 --> 14:09.600
Am I done?

337
14:09.790 --> 14:11.280
Oh... you are.

338
14:12.350 --> 14:13.360
I'll be back, then.

339
14:13.390 --> 14:14.340
Where are you going?

340
14:17.310 --> 14:18.160
I'm annoyed.

341
14:21.400 --> 14:22.480
I'm not in the next scene,

342
14:23.470 --> 14:24.880
so I'll go get some air.

343
14:31.340 --> 14:33.300
Alrighty, Wan. Come stand on your mark.

344
14:33.320 --> 14:34.560
Stand right on your mark.

345
14:35.050 --> 14:36.960
Okay, Wan is here!

346
14:37.050 --> 14:38.200
Karn, check the lighting.

347
14:42.580 --> 14:44.560
Don't you think the villain is wearing too much makeup?

348
14:46.870 --> 14:48.040
He's trying to steal the show for sure.

349
14:49.610 --> 14:51.280
Let's tone down his makeup.

350
14:54.220 --> 14:54.960
Jern.

351
14:55.470 --> 14:56.180
Jern.

352
14:57.300 --> 14:58.320
Gotta run something by you.

353
14:59.290 --> 15:00.480
Yes, what's up?

354
15:00.790 --> 15:03.480
Should we tone down Wan's makeup a bit?

355
15:06.190 --> 15:08.160
I think he has it on so heavy.

356
15:08.430 --> 15:09.080
Look,

357
15:09.200 --> 15:11.140
Nine has such a natural look.

358
15:14.180 --> 15:15.680
Pai, Pai.

359
15:15.870 --> 15:16.600
What?

360
15:17.400 --> 15:19.310
Wanna tone down Wan's makeup a bit?

361
15:19.330 --> 15:20.160
She asked.

362
15:21.090 --> 15:21.960
Good idea.

363
15:22.000 --> 15:24.080
It's a little... too heavy.

364
15:24.300 --> 15:25.780
Okay, okay, okay, alright.

365
15:25.950 --> 15:26.950
Susan,

366
15:28.470 --> 15:29.760
give that boy a hand.

367
15:29.910 --> 15:30.670
Okay, Mama.

368
15:31.220 --> 15:32.360
Let's go.

369
15:33.710 --> 15:34.800
That look's hard to work with.

370
15:35.880 --> 15:36.980
What are these dolly eyes?

371
15:37.560 --> 15:39.600
Wanna smash everyone while you steal their thunder?

372
15:40.350 --> 15:41.180
Next time, try...

373
15:41.200 --> 15:42.270
less gossiping.

374
15:42.290 --> 15:43.480
You might be easier to work with.

375
15:43.890 --> 15:44.600
Just a small tip.

376
15:45.260 --> 15:46.280
Queen,

377
15:46.780 --> 15:48.280
you're pretty fucking nosy.

378
15:49.200 --> 15:50.520
This is my job.

379
15:50.540 --> 15:52.450
Next time, do a good job on the main leads

380
15:52.470 --> 15:54.080
so you can skip toning down others' makeup.

381
15:54.190 --> 15:54.880
Right!

382
15:54.990 --> 15:56.510
Or maybe a crinkly, old MUA like you

383
15:56.530 --> 15:57.880
just can't keep up with the trends?

384
15:58.960 --> 15:59.440
Old?

385
16:00.430 --> 16:01.640
Your mom is!

386
16:03.170 --> 16:04.000
What kind of makeup is that?

387
16:04.210 --> 16:05.380
I thought that was a frog-hunting headlamp.

388
16:06.080 --> 16:07.290
I've never taught you

389
16:07.320 --> 16:08.280
to do dolly eyes like this.

390
16:08.870 --> 16:11.280
How about you come back and work for me, carrying my bags?

391
16:11.300 --> 16:13.360
Doesn't that seem more like your forte?

392
16:13.630 --> 16:15.120
Jern, are they done?

393
16:15.140 --> 16:16.550
I'm not going back so you guys

394
16:16.570 --> 16:17.800
can take your inferiority out on us.

395
16:17.880 --> 16:19.360
You tyrannical bunch!

396
16:19.590 --> 16:20.240
Jern...

397
16:20.440 --> 16:22.440
We once hired you two,

398
16:22.790 --> 16:24.720
so you must do what we say.

399
16:24.840 --> 16:27.160
Don't bite the hands that fed you,

400
16:27.270 --> 16:27.880
ungrateful bitches!

401
16:27.980 --> 16:29.030
Jern, Jern.

402
16:29.050 --> 16:30.280
Jern...

403
16:30.840 --> 16:31.920
Jern!

404
16:32.800 --> 16:34.120
Jern!!

405
16:35.770 --> 16:36.480
Are we all good?

406
16:36.500 --> 16:37.050
We are.

407
16:37.070 --> 16:37.970
His makeup is good now?

408
16:37.990 --> 16:39.290
He's nice and toned down.

409
16:39.310 --> 16:40.500
Okay, if we're all set,

410
16:40.520 --> 16:42.040
please go back to your spot.

411
16:42.080 --> 16:43.460
Nine, Nine, come on.

412
16:43.480 --> 16:44.960
Go to your mark.

413
16:45.380 --> 16:46.380
Okay...

414
16:47.080 --> 16:49.000
Here it is, your mark.

415
16:49.110 --> 16:50.070
Okay, you remember your lines?

416
16:50.090 --> 16:50.620
I do.

417
16:50.640 --> 16:51.610
Okay, done with the blocking.

418
16:51.630 --> 16:52.450
We're good?

419
16:52.470 --> 16:53.600
Alright, come on.

420
16:53.720 --> 16:56.270
Right, we're ready to roll.

421
16:56.290 --> 16:57.410
Crew, quiet!

422
16:57.430 --> 16:59.240
Ready? Let's go. Roll camera!

423
16:59.590 --> 17:00.520
Camera rolling!

424
17:01.180 --> 17:01.880
Set!

425
17:01.990 --> 17:03.480
- Alright, set! - Set!

426
17:03.500 --> 17:04.680
And...

427
17:05.069 --> 17:06.480
Action!

428
17:14.470 --> 17:16.380
You're just an incompetent guy

429
17:17.569 --> 17:18.880
who dreams of making it to the top.

430
17:20.069 --> 17:21.839
Why do you have to be so harsh?

431
17:22.380 --> 17:23.520
Isn't it true?

432
17:25.770 --> 17:27.579
I'm just working hard on my part.

433
17:28.900 --> 17:29.840
Working hard?

434
17:36.600 --> 17:37.680
Are you working hard,

435
17:38.520 --> 17:39.400
or sleeping your way to the top?

436
17:41.590 --> 17:42.400
Sky...

437
17:42.980 --> 17:45.160
"Truth never dies."

438
17:46.110 --> 17:47.480
But someone might just die...

439
17:48.720 --> 17:49.860
if "the truth" gets told.

440
17:59.000 --> 17:59.800
Cut!

441
17:59.960 --> 18:00.770
We're through.

442
18:00.790 --> 18:02.080
Alright, move on to the next scene.

443
18:02.100 --> 18:04.200
Take Wan to change his hair and makeup.

444
18:20.010 --> 18:21.040
What the heck are you doing?!

445
18:22.700 --> 18:23.380
You were good.

446
18:25.090 --> 18:25.680
Huh?

447
18:26.590 --> 18:27.640
You did amazing today.

448
18:34.190 --> 18:35.960
Are you seriously complimenting me?

449
18:38.000 --> 18:38.720
Why?

450
18:39.280 --> 18:40.280
Do you prefer I cuss you out?

451
18:40.750 --> 18:41.680
You're getting on my nerves.

452
18:44.310 --> 18:45.680
We're both done with our schedules today.

453
18:46.990 --> 18:47.900
Wanna head out with me?

454
18:48.980 --> 18:49.790
Are you nuts?

455
18:49.810 --> 18:50.880
As if Cher would let me.

456
18:51.900 --> 18:53.370
Don't you wanna go home early?

457
18:54.080 --> 18:55.400
Just don't forget to tell Cher.

458
18:56.030 --> 18:57.840
Then, what do I even tell her?

459
19:12.780 --> 19:13.640
You've got it...

460
19:13.790 --> 19:14.600
Shoot your shot.

461
19:54.690 --> 19:55.640
Hey, you.

462
19:56.210 --> 19:57.760
Is it a good idea to sit out here?

463
19:58.410 --> 19:59.600
I don't think it is.

464
20:03.110 --> 20:04.720
No one's around here this late.

465
20:05.280 --> 20:07.360
But what if someone recognizes you?

466
20:07.830 --> 20:08.760
You're famous!

467
20:09.080 --> 20:09.800
It's fine.

468
20:10.100 --> 20:10.920
I've been here plenty of times.

469
20:14.060 --> 20:15.900
Hey there, handsome.

470
20:15.920 --> 20:16.840
Back here again?

471
20:17.540 --> 20:18.920
So now we're shooing customers?

472
20:19.070 --> 20:20.180
My, my...

473
20:20.480 --> 20:22.120
I see you brought someone with you today.

474
20:22.700 --> 20:23.960
What would you like to order?

475
20:25.590 --> 20:26.520
What do you wanna eat?

476
20:27.320 --> 20:29.130
Wonton noodle soup with roasted red pork, please.

477
20:29.150 --> 20:31.360
- Wonton noodle soup, roasted red pork? - Yes.

478
20:31.590 --> 20:33.740
And the usual for you, Third?

479
20:34.340 --> 20:35.680
No chilli flakes, not spicy,

480
20:35.770 --> 20:37.270
with tons of veggies.

481
20:38.500 --> 20:38.900
Alrighty.

482
20:38.920 --> 20:39.870
Give me a moment.

483
20:39.890 --> 20:41.000
I'll be right back with it.

484
20:44.530 --> 20:46.120
This is my No. 1 noodle stall,

485
20:46.600 --> 20:47.600
the best in the entire world.

486
20:48.710 --> 20:49.640
You like noodles?

487
20:50.190 --> 20:50.790
Mm.

488
20:51.330 --> 20:51.960
Mm...

489
20:52.190 --> 20:52.880
Good.

490
20:53.100 --> 20:54.200
Then, some other time,

491
20:54.220 --> 20:57.360
I'll take you to a place that's the best in the galaxy!

492
21:06.180 --> 21:07.120
Thank you.

493
21:07.140 --> 21:08.320
Enjoy your food.

494
21:18.780 --> 21:20.000
Blow on it first.

495
21:20.990 --> 21:21.840
Alright, Uncle.

496
21:37.130 --> 21:38.080
Aren't you gonna season it?

497
21:40.010 --> 21:41.200
Want me to do it for you?

498
21:43.350 --> 21:44.260
Mm, go ahead.

499
21:45.200 --> 21:46.470
Let's start with this.

500
21:47.500 --> 21:48.500
Okay.

501
21:49.660 --> 21:51.200
Sugar...

502
21:54.260 --> 21:55.040
Alright,

503
21:55.380 --> 21:56.200
there you go,

504
21:57.860 --> 21:58.720
noodle soup for babies.

505
21:58.740 --> 21:59.460
I guarantee you,

506
21:59.480 --> 22:00.200
it's delicious.

507
22:09.480 --> 22:10.200
What do you think?

508
22:11.150 --> 22:12.280
Be nice.

509
22:12.590 --> 22:14.080
Don't forget I have hot soup at hand!

510
22:17.500 --> 22:18.500
How ruthless.

511
22:18.830 --> 22:20.000
It's delicious, Chef.

512
22:21.510 --> 22:22.440
No doubt!

513
22:46.780 --> 22:47.670
Wan,

514
22:47.690 --> 22:49.540
do you think... I should get hair extensions?

515
22:49.680 --> 22:51.160
Third might just like me!

516
22:51.430 --> 22:52.780
Mm, go ahead and get one.

517
22:54.560 --> 22:55.600
Can you give me money?

518
22:55.990 --> 22:56.880
No way.

519
22:56.900 --> 22:57.960
You have your own savings.

520
22:57.990 --> 22:59.840
Please, can you?!

521
22:59.860 --> 23:00.880
No!

522
23:01.590 --> 23:03.240
Not my head, not my problem.

523
23:03.590 --> 23:05.640
Maybe having long hair isn't even his type.

524
23:06.400 --> 23:07.640
Fucking cheap...

525
23:10.220 --> 23:10.840
Oh?

526
23:11.000 --> 23:12.510
But why are you still here?

527
23:12.530 --> 23:13.520
Not going on set?

528
23:13.870 --> 23:15.440
My ride will be here at 5 P.M.

529
23:15.600 --> 23:16.590
Night calls for night shoots.

530
23:16.610 --> 23:17.880
Night who?

531
23:18.280 --> 23:19.120
What's their role?

532
23:24.180 --> 23:25.140
That's not it...

533
23:25.160 --> 23:26.000
Here's the thing...

534
23:26.590 --> 23:28.600
Nighttime scenes

535
23:28.620 --> 23:29.810
are filmed during night shoots,

536
23:29.830 --> 23:30.800
so they gather

537
23:30.950 --> 23:32.250
all the nighttime scenes

538
23:32.520 --> 23:33.320
for night shoots.

539
23:33.640 --> 23:34.310
Oh...

540
23:34.330 --> 23:36.240
since series aren't filmed in chronological order.

541
23:36.260 --> 23:37.040
Mm.

542
23:37.230 --> 23:39.360
They group the locations into these shoots.

543
23:40.070 --> 23:41.840
Right, I was gonna compliment you.

544
23:41.860 --> 23:43.340
You created some nice buzz from the ceremony.

545
23:45.370 --> 23:47.040
What? Why the face?

546
23:47.610 --> 23:48.820
Something happened, huh?

547
23:51.080 --> 23:51.760
I think...

548
23:52.780 --> 23:54.080
Nine doesn't like me.

549
23:56.000 --> 23:57.080
Why would you think so?

550
24:01.090 --> 24:04.040
Nine entered the dressing room, not knowing I was there.

551
24:04.400 --> 24:06.280
But do we want Wan to become famous?

552
24:06.590 --> 24:08.100
- We do, right? - Exactly.

553
24:08.120 --> 24:08.920
Well... that'd be great.

554
24:08.940 --> 24:10.360
Scared Wan's gonna become more famous?

555
24:10.380 --> 24:11.800
How fucking annoying. What do you want?

556
24:11.820 --> 24:13.860
Be careful, or people will see your true nature.

557
24:13.880 --> 24:15.210
And Third was saying that...

558
24:15.230 --> 24:16.560
he'd expose him over something.

559
24:17.290 --> 24:18.060
Shit...

560
24:19.110 --> 24:20.580
How are they even partners?

561
24:22.980 --> 24:23.980
But I wanna know

562
24:24.000 --> 24:25.240
why they're fighting.

563
24:25.550 --> 24:26.030
Maybe...

564
24:26.050 --> 24:27.380
they were boyfriends before?

565
24:27.730 --> 24:28.440
Huh?!

566
24:28.730 --> 24:30.080
Why so surprised?!

567
24:30.400 --> 24:31.920
Dude, it's possible,

568
24:32.280 --> 24:33.720
giving their over-the-top chemistry.

569
24:34.580 --> 24:35.240
I don't think...

570
24:35.570 --> 24:36.780
that's the case?

571
24:37.160 --> 24:38.720
They're just friends.

572
24:39.040 --> 24:40.800
That's all the more reason to speculate.

573
24:41.190 --> 24:42.160
Think about it.

574
24:42.680 --> 24:44.600
Friends who hate each other this much

575
24:44.620 --> 24:46.400
must have loved each other deeply once.

576
24:46.740 --> 24:48.770
And what do Ayutthaya people call former friends

577
24:48.790 --> 24:50.200
who loathe each other?

578
24:50.730 --> 24:51.680
Exes!

579
24:52.660 --> 24:54.790
It feels to me like they were once a real couple.

580
24:54.810 --> 24:55.610
Trust me.

581
24:57.700 --> 24:58.360
Hey...

582
24:59.120 --> 25:00.680
wire me 7,000 baht.

583
25:00.700 --> 25:01.480
Consulting fee.

584
25:02.890 --> 25:04.040
I'm getting hair extensions.

585
25:04.560 --> 25:05.520
Don't forget to wire me.

586
25:18.600 --> 25:19.370
Wan.

587
25:22.060 --> 25:23.120
Come with me.

588
25:23.890 --> 25:25.280
Nine wants to have a word with you.

589
25:25.820 --> 25:27.400
He said he wanted to talk things out.

590
25:31.400 --> 25:32.280
Alright...

591
26:02.020 --> 26:03.920
Nine is up there.

592
26:05.020 --> 26:07.240
Go have a word up there, just you two,

593
26:07.470 --> 26:08.990
so no one else can hear.

594
26:09.980 --> 26:11.390
And talk it out nicely.

595
26:12.800 --> 26:14.280
Do you understand what I'm saying?

596
26:16.400 --> 26:17.400
Thank you.

597
26:18.020 --> 26:18.840
Run along.

598
26:28.160 --> 26:28.800
Go.

599
26:58.980 --> 26:59.980
You do know

600
27:01.210 --> 27:02.210
exactly what you're doing, right?

601
27:07.700 --> 27:08.800
I don't.

602
27:10.400 --> 27:11.160
Good.

603
27:13.200 --> 27:15.060
Then, how about we start with you...

604
27:15.080 --> 27:16.740
chasing clout by jumping off the stage

605
27:16.760 --> 27:17.960
to help that fan?

606
27:24.290 --> 27:25.600
She was passing out.

607
27:25.890 --> 27:27.460
I needed to help her

608
27:27.820 --> 27:29.520
or no one would.

609
27:29.680 --> 27:30.600
Then swear

610
27:34.300 --> 27:36.480
you didn't do it just to compete with me for buzz.

611
27:37.490 --> 27:39.400
And what does that have to do with anything, Nine?

612
27:42.420 --> 27:44.200
You're pushing my buttons, you know that?

613
27:46.640 --> 27:48.080
Then what about the Peppermint Field gig?

614
27:48.930 --> 27:50.380
You poached that from me.

615
27:50.530 --> 27:53.680
Do you know a client has called to cancel?

616
27:53.700 --> 27:55.540
And do you know

617
27:55.570 --> 27:56.160
who landed the gig?

618
27:56.830 --> 27:57.680
Wan.

619
27:59.150 --> 28:00.290
The Peppermint Field gig?

620
28:01.800 --> 28:02.840
What about it, Nine?

621
28:07.200 --> 28:09.080
You're fucking unbelievable.

622
28:11.800 --> 28:13.800
Your acting has gotten so much better, Wan.

623
28:15.750 --> 28:17.920
Is it because you got your own private coach?

624
28:24.580 --> 28:25.280
Come on...

625
28:26.780 --> 28:28.240
Blow the flower on my finger, yeah?

626
28:31.680 --> 28:33.460
Do you really think he only did this to you?

627
28:34.690 --> 28:35.360
Huh?

628
28:38.190 --> 28:39.760
What the hell do you want from me?

629
28:40.790 --> 28:43.080
Everyone knows you're stealing my partner.

630
28:43.960 --> 28:45.280
Still confused now?

631
28:48.810 --> 28:49.590
Oh...

632
28:50.340 --> 28:51.160
Now you're silent?

633
28:54.800 --> 28:55.960
Answer me, Wan.

634
28:56.530 --> 28:57.180
Hey, Nine.

635
28:57.200 --> 28:59.080
You've got me so wrong.

636
29:03.400 --> 29:04.900
[On second thought, I think Wan is a better fit for Noel than Nine. Look at the chemistry. #ThirdWan]

637
29:04.920 --> 29:06.400
And what does this mean?

638
29:08.700 --> 29:09.790
Come on, explain.

639
29:11.080 --> 29:13.000
Third asked me to go home together.

640
29:13.200 --> 29:15.120
We finished our schedules at the same time, so we did.

641
29:15.340 --> 29:16.120
And?

642
29:16.930 --> 29:18.190
We just stopped for food.

643
29:18.210 --> 29:19.720
That's it. Nothing else, Nine.

644
29:19.890 --> 29:20.840
Are you sure

645
29:21.890 --> 29:22.890
there's nothing else?

646
29:29.340 --> 29:30.160
Say it!

647
29:32.280 --> 29:33.660
If I do,

648
29:33.690 --> 29:35.160
you're gonna say I'm making excuses.

649
29:36.340 --> 29:38.150
So that means you know

650
29:38.900 --> 29:40.160
exactly what you're doing, huh?!

651
29:43.000 --> 29:44.080
That day,

652
29:44.270 --> 29:45.800
I let it slide

653
29:46.920 --> 29:48.890
when you and Third were about to kiss,

654
29:49.390 --> 29:51.050
and now you think you can do whatever you want?

655
29:51.070 --> 29:51.480
Huh?

656
29:53.620 --> 29:54.820
You're into Third!

657
29:55.490 --> 29:56.500
Admit it.

658
30:00.800 --> 30:02.120
Fucking admit it, Wan!

659
30:03.500 --> 30:04.750
I don't have feelings for him!

660
30:04.770 --> 30:05.640
Bullshit!

661
30:07.490 --> 30:08.460
Is that by nature,

662
30:08.480 --> 30:09.660
or something your parents nurtured in you?!

663
30:09.690 --> 30:10.880
Whoa, Nine!

664
30:11.890 --> 30:12.760
Why?

665
30:15.900 --> 30:17.080
Gonna punch me?

666
30:17.480 --> 30:18.320
Go on!

667
30:20.370 --> 30:21.140
Punch me.

668
30:22.070 --> 30:22.880
Do it.

669
30:23.600 --> 30:24.560
What about you?

670
30:25.000 --> 30:27.640
Do you admit that you tried to drown me on purpose?

671
30:27.660 --> 30:28.560
Yeah, I admit it.

672
30:37.330 --> 30:38.640
Why would you do it?

673
30:40.060 --> 30:41.750
Why do you hate me so much?!

674
30:42.340 --> 30:43.840
I'm your fan!

675
30:45.120 --> 30:46.840
Still have the nerve to call yourself my "fan"?

676
30:47.040 --> 30:48.850
If I weren't your fan,

677
30:48.870 --> 30:50.900
why'd I trend your hashtags and mass-stream for you?!

678
30:51.210 --> 30:53.160
I don't get paid a dime for it!

679
31:01.660 --> 31:02.920
Did I ask you to?

680
31:05.930 --> 31:07.300
How the fuck could you say that?!

681
31:07.320 --> 31:08.320
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

682
31:08.870 --> 31:10.160
Wan, Wan, Wan, Wan.

683
31:10.800 --> 31:11.760
I'm sorry.

684
31:11.780 --> 31:13.560
Wan... I didn't mean to.

685
31:17.490 --> 31:18.400
Is that it?

686
31:19.380 --> 31:20.640
Is that what you want?

687
31:20.760 --> 31:21.200
Huh?

688
31:24.380 --> 31:26.130
Is that what you imagine in your little head?

689
31:26.150 --> 31:27.960
That's what you want me to say?!

690
31:27.980 --> 31:28.660
Huh?!

691
31:28.680 --> 31:29.360
No.

692
31:30.320 --> 31:32.300
From now on, I'm not your fan anymore!

693
31:32.320 --> 31:33.480
Do whatever you want.

694
31:33.770 --> 31:35.120
Why the fuck are you telling me?!

695
31:43.090 --> 31:44.040
You know?

696
31:44.870 --> 31:46.020
I've been wanting to say this shit

697
31:46.040 --> 31:47.760
to shitty fans like you for ages!

698
31:48.080 --> 31:49.070
There's one more thing

699
31:49.090 --> 31:50.800
I'm dying for you to quit doing.

700
31:51.000 --> 31:54.120
Stop taking my photos and posting them on your account for clout!

701
31:55.190 --> 31:56.160
Your account...

702
31:56.520 --> 31:57.760
What the fuck was it?

703
31:58.980 --> 32:00.200
"onetonine," was it?

704
32:01.900 --> 32:02.590
Huh?

705
32:04.570 --> 32:06.560
The photos you took weren't even fucking nice!

706
32:09.930 --> 32:12.100
When that day arrives, and we come across each other again...

707
32:12.770 --> 32:13.400
please...

708
32:13.640 --> 32:15.040
take some nice photos of me.

709
32:32.400 --> 32:33.980
The engagement, the followers,

710
32:34.000 --> 32:35.980
and everything else on that fucking account

711
32:36.090 --> 32:37.110
are all from me!

712
32:37.130 --> 32:38.240
Not you!

713
32:38.440 --> 32:40.880
You're just lucky enough to take my photos!

714
32:52.980 --> 32:54.280
Rest assured.

715
32:54.300 --> 32:55.470
I'll do everything I can

716
32:55.490 --> 32:57.030
to help you succeed, Nine,

717
32:57.610 --> 32:59.520
because I'm your fanboy.

718
33:02.770 --> 33:04.040
Stop liking me, you fucking bastard!

719
33:10.080 --> 33:11.040
Fine!

720
33:14.990 --> 33:15.910
From now on,

721
33:15.930 --> 33:17.700
I'm done being everything for you.

722
33:19.080 --> 33:20.680
I'm going to be your rival.

723
33:21.220 --> 33:22.520
I'll be even better than you.

724
33:22.990 --> 33:24.560
I'll step on your head.

725
33:32.790 --> 33:33.520
Wan...

726
33:34.170 --> 33:35.600
Good job, Wan!

727
33:38.240 --> 33:39.560
Now, you and I

728
33:40.660 --> 33:42.320
are speaking the same language, you know that?

729
33:44.940 --> 33:46.560
But I'll let you in on a secret.

730
33:46.980 --> 33:48.400
If you want to compete with me,

731
33:49.710 --> 33:52.240
good luck crawling your way to where I am.

732
33:53.770 --> 33:54.560
Alright.

733
33:57.290 --> 33:58.760
Watch your back, though.

734
34:06.230 --> 34:07.920
Falling from where you are might not hurt,

735
34:10.460 --> 34:11.550
but it sure is embarrassing.

736
34:24.960 --> 34:25.960
How?

737
34:28.790 --> 34:29.530
How so, Wan?

738
34:29.550 --> 34:30.100
Whoa...

739
34:31.170 --> 34:32.380
Nine, we're not doing this!

740
34:35.150 --> 34:36.440
We're not, Wan?

741
34:37.520 --> 34:38.679
We're not!

742
34:44.190 --> 34:45.280
But how?

743
34:45.760 --> 34:46.639
Whoa, Wan?

744
34:49.510 --> 34:50.780
We're not doing this...

745
34:54.020 --> 34:54.840
You mean, this?

746
35:04.220 --> 35:05.280
Whoa, fuck!

747
35:08.030 --> 35:09.600
Guys, someone fell into the pool!

748
35:09.620 --> 35:10.870
Help him!

749
35:10.890 --> 35:11.960
- Go! - Whoa!

750
35:18.610 --> 35:19.320
Nine!

751
35:21.890 --> 35:22.530
Nine!

752
35:22.560 --> 35:23.120
Nine!

753
35:23.600 --> 35:24.290
Nine.

754
35:29.440 --> 35:30.120
Nine...

755
35:47.250 --> 35:48.080
Wan,

756
35:48.760 --> 35:50.240
how could you do this to my baby?!

757
35:50.450 --> 35:51.070
Huh?!

758
35:53.760 --> 35:54.230
Whoa!

759
35:54.250 --> 35:55.120
Oh, goodness!

760
36:01.290 --> 36:02.190
What the hell are you doing?!

761
36:02.210 --> 36:03.090
Move!

762
36:03.700 --> 36:04.700
If you don't,

763
36:04.870 --> 36:06.120
I'll slap you to the ground!

764
36:06.140 --> 36:07.480
If you're gonna hurt my baby,

765
36:07.500 --> 36:08.600
just go ahead and slap me!

766
36:09.350 --> 36:09.920
Fine.

767
36:10.390 --> 36:11.080
I'm gonna mess you up!

768
36:11.750 --> 36:13.120
- Want me to slap the shit out of you, huh?! - Ms. Sunny!

769
36:13.140 --> 36:14.300
- Ms. Sunny! Miss! - Don't!

770
36:14.320 --> 36:15.490
- Let go! - Come on, do your worst!

771
36:15.510 --> 36:16.400
Come at us, I dare you!

772
36:16.420 --> 36:17.820
If you do, I'll fucking punch you!

773
36:17.850 --> 36:18.720
You bitch, picking on a woman!

774
36:18.750 --> 36:20.060
You trashy, nancy pants!

775
36:20.080 --> 36:21.200
Can you fucking stop?!

776
36:21.490 --> 36:22.050
Well, these...

777
36:22.070 --> 36:23.160
- These bitches just... - I said stop!

778
36:23.380 --> 36:24.870
Why do you keep fucking fighting?!

779
36:24.890 --> 36:25.690
Well, look at them!

780
36:25.710 --> 36:27.310
How many times have I said "stop"?!

781
36:27.330 --> 36:28.020
Look at what they're doing!

782
36:28.050 --> 36:28.680
Stop!!

783
36:37.990 --> 36:39.200
Get a fucking grip

784
36:39.220 --> 36:40.640
and stop being a fucking psycho!

785
36:41.590 --> 36:42.800
Get what fucking grip?!

786
36:44.020 --> 36:45.880
Your boy shoved mine into the pool!

787
36:45.900 --> 36:46.900
Where's the proof?!

788
36:47.380 --> 36:49.860
Did you see my boy do it with your own eyes?!

789
36:50.180 --> 36:51.110
Without proof,

790
36:51.130 --> 36:52.320
this is an accusation.

791
36:54.300 --> 36:55.190
Renji,

792
36:55.210 --> 36:57.000
take Wan to pack up, then wait for me at the car.

793
37:06.000 --> 37:07.690
- Go. - Rin, are you alright?

794
37:07.710 --> 37:08.710
Where are you running off to?

795
37:08.900 --> 37:09.530
- Huh?! - Sunny!

796
37:09.550 --> 37:10.750
- Where are you going?! - Here we go again!

797
37:10.770 --> 37:12.080
- Come back here! - Pai, go deal with them!

798
37:12.580 --> 37:13.650
You want a taste of my hand so much?!

799
37:13.670 --> 37:14.650
- Come here! - Bring it on!

800
37:14.670 --> 37:15.680
Bring it on!

801
37:18.370 --> 37:20.280
- How about we stop... - Ugh! Sticking to me like a tick.

802
37:20.300 --> 37:22.080
- Get them to stop! - Hey!

803
37:22.310 --> 37:22.930
Ow...

804
37:22.950 --> 37:24.590
Uh, how about we stop?!

805
37:24.610 --> 37:25.360
Piss off!

806
37:25.380 --> 37:25.980
Piss off!

807
37:26.000 --> 37:26.720
You piss off!

808
37:27.320 --> 37:28.640
Ugh, stop at once!

809
37:28.800 --> 37:30.090
Take Nine to the doctor!

810
37:30.110 --> 37:31.160
Fuck this headscarf!

811
37:32.770 --> 37:33.640
Listen to me!

812
37:34.080 --> 37:37.200
Don't breathe a word about what happened on set!

813
37:37.580 --> 37:39.320
If this gets leaked,

814
37:39.340 --> 37:41.240
be damn ready to pay up!

815
37:41.600 --> 37:42.030
I'll

816
37:42.050 --> 37:42.390
fucking

817
37:42.410 --> 37:43.160
sue!

818
37:43.530 --> 37:44.380
Are you okay?

819
37:45.780 --> 37:46.760
I am, Mama.

820
37:47.030 --> 37:48.630
Trust me, go to the hospital.

821
37:48.650 --> 37:49.790
Your hands are freezing cold.

822
37:50.220 --> 37:51.590
- Huh? - It's fine, it's fine.

823
37:51.610 --> 37:53.360
I don't wanna blow things out of proportion.

824
37:53.380 --> 37:54.480
Let's just go...

825
38:13.370 --> 38:14.160
Nine?

826
38:14.570 --> 38:15.240
What?

827
38:21.480 --> 38:22.230
Are you alright?

828
38:23.070 --> 38:23.500
What happened?

829
38:23.520 --> 38:24.420
Tell me.

830
38:27.260 --> 38:28.120
I...

831
38:28.650 --> 38:29.980
talked to Wan about Third,

832
38:30.800 --> 38:32.040
and we got into a little fight.

833
38:34.480 --> 38:35.800
And he pushed you?

834
38:40.980 --> 38:41.740
Yes.

835
38:43.890 --> 38:44.890
Okay...

836
38:46.190 --> 38:47.520
I guess I have to remove him now.

837
38:50.810 --> 38:52.600
Well... it's all up to you.

838
39:04.330 --> 39:05.090
Dude, dude, dude,

839
39:05.110 --> 39:07.000
I just got hair extensions. Isn't it pretty?

840
39:19.540 --> 39:20.320
Wan?

841
40:08.520 --> 40:09.680
Do whatever you want.

842
40:09.940 --> 40:11.320
Why the fuck are you telling me?!

843
40:13.510 --> 40:14.400
You know?

844
40:14.770 --> 40:15.940
I've been wanting to say this shit

845
40:15.960 --> 40:17.520
to shitty fans like you for ages!

846
40:19.220 --> 40:22.280
Stop taking my photos and posting them on your account for clout!

847
40:29.250 --> 40:30.320
Hello,

848
40:30.820 --> 40:31.760
this is Nine.

849
40:33.300 --> 40:35.200
I hope you have a good day.

850
40:35.720 --> 40:37.400
I want you all to smile a ton

851
40:38.130 --> 40:39.880
and be happy every day,

852
40:40.720 --> 40:42.080
my fans.

853
41:46.410 --> 41:47.890
Ready to tell me what happened?

854
41:55.610 --> 41:56.840
He spewed insults at me...

855
41:58.700 --> 42:00.220
He genuinely hates me.

856
42:02.910 --> 42:04.240
He said that I post

857
42:04.260 --> 42:05.920
his photos for my own clout.

858
42:07.780 --> 42:08.600
Fuck...

859
42:10.600 --> 42:11.200
Damn it...

860
42:11.580 --> 42:12.800
This hurts like hell.

861
42:18.280 --> 42:19.600
It's gonna be fine.

862
42:20.370 --> 42:21.860
If Nine does anything to you again,

863
42:21.880 --> 42:23.520
I'm going to the set with you.

864
42:38.800 --> 42:40.040
I'd better grab a bite.

865
42:43.280 --> 42:44.240
I'm not gonna die because of this!

866
42:45.040 --> 42:45.640
That's right!

867
42:46.050 --> 42:47.200
To hell with them,

868
42:47.220 --> 42:48.280
but not my brother!

869
42:48.700 --> 42:49.710
Go find something to eat.

870
42:49.730 --> 42:50.740
I'll clean this up.

871
43:00.790 --> 43:01.880
You're getting a piece of me!

872
43:02.080 --> 43:03.000
I'll clean it up nice and neat!

873
43:28.090 --> 43:28.780
Whoa...

874
43:29.370 --> 43:30.440
Why are you here?

875
43:32.020 --> 43:33.080
To see you, of course.

876
43:36.330 --> 43:37.280
Are you a sasaeng?

877
43:38.000 --> 43:38.960
Huh?

878
43:39.180 --> 43:40.560
You're using that word now?

879
43:41.300 --> 43:42.440
Right, I forgot...

880
43:42.620 --> 43:43.620
you're a star now.

881
43:48.780 --> 43:50.240
Did you come here just to see me?

882
43:52.880 --> 43:53.600
Mm.

883
43:59.790 --> 44:01.160
What if I never came down?

884
44:02.580 --> 44:03.840
I'd go up to your room.

885
44:04.330 --> 44:05.320
Do you know where my room is?

886
44:06.540 --> 44:07.280
No.

887
44:08.080 --> 44:08.880
So why did you come?

888
44:12.790 --> 44:13.680
I'm worried about you.

889
44:25.160 --> 44:26.640
Seeing you here,

890
44:28.270 --> 44:30.080
I don't know how to act.

891
44:30.900 --> 44:31.880
You don't?

892
44:39.190 --> 44:40.500
Have you been crying?

893
44:41.900 --> 44:42.720
Mm...

894
44:47.350 --> 44:48.600
Come on, let's sneak out!

895
44:51.380 --> 44:52.000
Huh?

896
44:53.400 --> 44:55.200
If someone sees us, there'll be another problem.

897
44:55.760 --> 44:57.480
It's already a big enough deal as it is.

898
44:59.290 --> 45:00.570
What did you say then?

899
45:01.230 --> 45:03.470
"The worst that can happen is getting chewed out, no?"

900
45:07.330 --> 45:08.080
Let's go.

901
45:11.180 --> 45:11.840
Chop-chop.

902
45:42.860 --> 45:44.880
Just in case the wind blows the bad feelings away.

903
46:11.010 --> 46:12.560
I retouched your damn photos!

904
46:14.310 --> 46:15.840
I slimmed your face down!

905
46:16.210 --> 46:16.960
I removed those blemishes

906
46:16.980 --> 46:19.080
and smoothed your skin until my eyes were about to bleed!

907
46:20.370 --> 46:22.020
I even trended your hashtags until I couldn't move my fingers...

908
46:22.340 --> 46:23.920
I did everything for you!

909
46:24.630 --> 46:26.350
But you cussed me out!

910
46:27.110 --> 46:28.180
I'm done!

911
46:28.200 --> 46:29.810
I'm fucking done, asshole!

912
46:58.090 --> 46:59.290
Why is there a bench here?

913
47:01.300 --> 47:02.760
I brought it from home.

914
47:06.540 --> 47:07.280
Funny.

915
47:09.290 --> 47:10.360
Do I look like I'm being funny?

916
47:14.770 --> 47:15.410
You are...

917
47:23.690 --> 47:24.920
When I first entered the industry,

918
47:25.600 --> 47:26.880
I loved coming here.

919
47:29.410 --> 47:31.080
I liked gazing at the clear, open sky.

920
47:31.990 --> 47:33.360
It cleared my head.

921
47:36.510 --> 47:37.550
In this industry,

922
47:38.020 --> 47:39.320
things can be pretty hard on you,

923
47:41.180 --> 47:42.840
so I felt like I needed a getaway.

924
47:47.970 --> 47:49.840
Don't take everything in this world to heart.

925
47:50.100 --> 47:50.960
It's heavy...

926
47:58.270 --> 47:59.080
Is it heavy?

927
48:03.830 --> 48:04.500
Mm...

928
48:06.450 --> 48:07.610
I never thought

929
48:07.630 --> 48:08.360
that...

930
48:08.620 --> 48:10.800
there would be so many things to stress over as an actor.

931
48:12.280 --> 48:14.090
I thought it was an easy job.

932
48:14.700 --> 48:16.180
Just dressing up nice,

933
48:16.200 --> 48:17.370
getting your makeup done,

934
48:17.940 --> 48:19.340
meeting your fans,

935
48:20.210 --> 48:22.600
then going home to your family with money.

936
48:25.010 --> 48:26.080
But in reality,

937
48:26.540 --> 48:27.600
it's nothing like that.

938
48:29.210 --> 48:31.040
It's true that being an actor pays well,

939
48:32.870 --> 48:34.680
but it comes at the cost of carrying so much.

940
48:38.840 --> 48:40.160
There are plenty of bad things,

941
48:41.490 --> 48:42.880
but good things come out of it, too.

942
48:43.590 --> 48:44.960
You just have to find them.

943
48:48.890 --> 48:50.320
Mm... that's true.

944
48:51.890 --> 48:53.360
Some good things did happen.

945
48:54.300 --> 48:55.720
Can you let me in

946
48:56.120 --> 48:57.760
on those things?

947
48:58.830 --> 49:00.340
Hm...

948
49:05.300 --> 49:06.920
I paid off my family's debt.

949
49:10.180 --> 49:12.800
I still remember the moment I wired Mom that money.

950
49:14.580 --> 49:15.200
Whoa...

951
49:16.100 --> 49:17.720
Still new to the industry and already paid it off?

952
49:18.800 --> 49:19.640
Talk about being fortunate.

953
49:20.640 --> 49:21.720
What do you mean, "fortunate"?

954
49:23.200 --> 49:25.770
In return, if I break the contract,

955
49:25.790 --> 49:27.340
I'll be fined 2 million baht.

956
49:27.570 --> 49:29.480
That's why I've been grinding nonstop.

957
49:32.460 --> 49:34.480
So that means there's a reason for you to keep going?

958
49:35.320 --> 49:36.250
Those who don't love you

959
49:36.270 --> 49:37.780
have already shown themselves.

960
49:39.420 --> 49:41.280
How about focusing on those who love you for a change?

961
49:42.480 --> 49:43.760
Those who love me?

962
49:51.380 --> 49:52.720
Your fans, that is.

963
49:53.500 --> 49:54.720
Not to mention Cher.

964
49:55.930 --> 49:56.690
Mm...

965
49:56.710 --> 49:57.480
you're right.

966
49:59.910 --> 50:01.810
I found myself in the same situation you're in.

967
50:02.850 --> 50:04.500
Some I overcame.

968
50:04.520 --> 50:05.760
Some I didn't.

969
50:06.480 --> 50:07.690
What you're facing...

970
50:08.730 --> 50:10.400
isn't because the industry is bad,

971
50:12.590 --> 50:14.280
but because of the people.

972
50:15.920 --> 50:17.130
Not everyone, though.

973
50:17.910 --> 50:18.800
Not all of them.

974
50:22.690 --> 50:23.690
Real talk,

975
50:25.030 --> 50:26.640
how about you try talking like this

976
50:27.470 --> 50:29.000
when you give interviews to the press?

977
50:30.510 --> 50:32.480
I bet tons of people will fall in love with you.

978
50:38.520 --> 50:39.580
You included?

979
50:53.500 --> 50:54.080
What happened today...

980
50:55.210 --> 50:57.720
even if everyone on set said you did it,

981
50:59.400 --> 51:00.400
I wouldn't believe them.

982
51:06.980 --> 51:07.800
You're...

983
51:08.300 --> 51:10.360
not gonna hear my side of the story?

984
51:11.200 --> 51:12.640
I trust you.

985
51:18.220 --> 51:20.100
I know you'd never do something like that.

986
51:23.690 --> 51:24.960
What did Nine do to you?

987
51:34.000 --> 51:35.960
He said I stole his gigs

988
51:38.570 --> 51:39.440
and...

989
51:40.820 --> 51:42.260
stole you from him.

990
51:46.500 --> 51:48.360
One thing I can assure you of

991
51:49.360 --> 51:51.080
is that you never stole me from him.

992
51:52.390 --> 51:54.040
I came to you myself.

993
51:59.490 --> 52:00.400
Thank you...

994
52:01.470 --> 52:02.590
for saving me.

995
52:19.300 --> 52:21.260
Instead of a thank-you,

996
52:23.290 --> 52:25.320
can I ask you not to cry?

997
52:42.240 --> 52:43.580
